(1570, '1528843858740510820', '585541589976219679', 'Dante Inferno', 'e4ab62c328331eb319cadd4e00185032', 'Keep the EXACT original artwork without redesigning anything.\n\nDo not change the composition.\nDo not change the logo.\nDo not change the typography.\nDo not change the hand.\nDo not change the cars.\nDo not change the skyline.\nDo not change the palm trees.\nDo not change the skull.\nDo not change the ornaments.\nDo not zoom.\nDo not pan.\nDo not rotate.\nThe camera is perfectly locked.\n\nAnimate only the environment.\n\nDark storm clouds slowly move across the sky.\nLightning flashes behind the logo.\nHeavy rain falls diagonally.\nOrange embers float through the air.\nFire behind the logo grows naturally.\nSmall flames appear around the frame.\nThe skull eyes ignite with orange fire.\nThe flames inside the eyes move realistically.\nCar headlights softly pulse.\nWater reflections shimmer gently.\nLightning illuminates the entire artwork for brief cinematic flashes.\nEverything remains perfectly aligned.\nUltra realistic cinematic lighting.\nDark bronze and black color palette.\nHigh contrast.\nSeamless loop.\n8K quality.', '[]', 1785076228131),
